    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_878_2489.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich willig diennst, sampt was wir
<lb n="2"/>eeren, liebs, unnd guots <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermögennt</unclear>, zuovor
<lb n="3"/>fromen fürsichtigen, ersamen, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wysen</unclear>,
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innsonnders</unclear> guoten fründ, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>lieben <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydgnosen</unclear></orgName>. Nachdem
<lb n="6"/>unnser burger <persName resp="#ner">Jacob <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jännj</unclear></persName>, mit tod abgang,
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">drü</unclear> eeliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unertzogne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kinnd</unclear>, unnd aber
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dhein</unclear> guot, daruß die selben, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erhallten</unclear> werd
<lb n="9"/>mögen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlassen</unclear>. Hatt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desselbig</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlasne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hußfrow</unclear>, unnsers <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgers</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><persName resp="#ner">Heinrich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sutzen</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eewürtin</unclear>, <persName resp="#ner">Barbara <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hugin</unclear></persName>
<lb n="12"/>genannt, so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorgemellts</unclear> ires manns vatter
<lb n="13"/>seligen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwöster</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewäsen</unclear>, vor unns mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">recht</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angelanngt</unclear>, unnd vermeint, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diewyl</unclear> sy
<lb n="15"/>die nechst erbin, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllte</unclear> sy die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kinnd</unclear> zuo iren
<lb n="16"/>hannden nemen, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ertzüchen</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear>-
<lb n="17"/>durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sovil</unclear> erhallten, das der gedachten
<lb n="18"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hugin</unclear></persName>, die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kinnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuobehusen</unclear>, von unns uf-
<lb n="19"/>erlegt worden. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">So</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fer</unclear> dann sach, das sy
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">necher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünnd</unclear> wüßte, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllichs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zethuond</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>schuldig weren, möge sy die selbigen darumb
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">suochen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Deßhalben</unclear> dann die genant
<lb n="23"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hugin</unclear></persName>, widerumb vor unns erschinen, unnd
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angetzöigt</unclear>. Wie das obge-
<lb n="25"/>dachter <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jännj</unclear>, ein eeliche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schwöster</unclear>, <persName resp="#ner">Mar-
<lb n="26"/>gretha <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jänin</unclear></persName> genannt, hinnder im <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlas</unclear>-
<lb n="27"/>so inn üwer stat wonhafft, unnd vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zyt</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hannsen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kätzlj</unclear></persName> zuo irem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eeman</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehept</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>hette, welliche <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eemts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">necher</unclear> gefründt
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_878_2490.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sy</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deßhalben</unclear> unns ganntz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thruengenlich</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ulßig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepaeten</unclear>, wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welten</unclear> iro, mit
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuerschrifft</unclear>, gegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">behuelffenn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear>.
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Trostlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoversicht</unclear>, dardurch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">souil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerlang</unclear>,
<lb n="34"/>das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iren</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kinnder</unclear>, alls einem allten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">armenn</unclear>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyb</unclear>, die sich selbs <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kuemerlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußbrinngen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>erneren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moege</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgenomen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wuerden</unclear>. Unnd
<lb n="37"/>wann nun uns, diß ir pitt, der billicheit, nit, unge-
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedunnckt</unclear>, so lanngt
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hieruf</unclear> an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uech</unclear>, unnser ganntz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruendtlich</unclear> pitt
<lb n="40"/>ir wellent, uß oberzellten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gruenden</unclear>, unnd ursach
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obgedachte</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Margretha <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Irnin</unclear></persName>, so by <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wonhaft</unclear>,
<lb n="42"/>dahin hallten, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegen</unclear>, das sy die
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">drue</unclear> kind, so ir brueder verlassen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuerderlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear>
<lb n="44"/>iren hannden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neme</unclear>, unnd sy nach notturfft er-
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueche</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> allso <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierinn</unclear>, nach
<lb n="46"/>der billicheit, unnd unnserm sonndern ver-
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thruwen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewyßen</unclear>. Das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stat</unclear> unns
<lb n="48"/>umb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uech</unclear> inn aller <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoeßischer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">threuow</unclear>
<lb n="49"/>ganntz guotwillig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuouerdienen</unclear>. Dat <origDate when="1566-03-07" cert="medium" resp="#ner">don-
<lb n="50"/>stags den 7 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">t</unclear> Martij. Anno etc 66</origDate>.
<lb n="51"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd rath,
<lb n="52"/>der Statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zuerich</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_878_2491.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_878_2492.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="53"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear> fürsichtigen ersamen
<lb n="54"/>und wysen. <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister
<lb n="55"/>unnd rath der statt Sannt Gallen</orgName>
<lb n="56"/>unnsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innsonnders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear> frün-
<lb n="57"/>den unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben eydt-
<lb n="58"/>gnossen.
</p>
